        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sam Witwer\n- Roles: Crashdown, Davis Bloome, Aidan Waite\n- Television Series: Battlestar Galactica, Smallville, Being Human\n- Companies: Muse\n- Places: United States, Canada, Montreal\n- Topics: American actors, musicians, television remakes\n\nFacts:\n- Sam Witwer was born on October 20, 1977, and he is an American actor and musician.\n- Sam Witwer portrayed Crashdown in Battlestar Galactica.\n- Sam Witwer portrayed Davis Bloome in Smallville.\n- Sam Witwer portrayed the vampire Aidan Waite in the North American television series Being Human.\n- Being Human is a supernatural drama television series broadcast on Syfy in the United States and on Space in Canada.\n- Being Human was produced by Muse in Montreal as a remake of the BBC television show of the same name.",
